<title>USA: Horizon/CMS shares buoyed by relief.</title>
<headline>Horizon/CMS shares buoyed by relief.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon/CMS Healthare Corp shareholders breathed a sigh of relief that the company's announced $5.8 million settlement with state and federal agencies over certain Medicare billings was not larger, analysts said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has potentially resolved a very serious issue which was very difficult to define,&quot; said Eugene Melnitchenko, an analyst at Principal Financial Securities in Dallas. &quot;The potential liability could have been much higher.&quot;</p>
</text>
